<div class="blk"><h6>C · 贴片 <span>淡底贴片用于侧栏与应用图标，深底贴片用于 favicon 与深色场合；圆角 11 / 48</span></h6><div class="paper"><div class="tiles"><div class="tl"><div class="r"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e4ecfc"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e4ecfc"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#2c63c8"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#2c63c8"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg></div><small>TCRN TMS · 淡底 64 / 32 · 深底 64 / 32</small></div><div class="tl"><div class="r"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e6ecf3"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#3b5272"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#3b5272"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e6ecf3"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#3b5272"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#3b5272"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#3b5272"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#3b5272"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg></div><small>Einzbern · 淡底 64 / 32 · 深底 64 / 32</small></div><div class="tl"><div class="r"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e5f5e6"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#9ddc8c" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#e5f5e6"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#9ddc8c" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#3a9a63"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#ffffff"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#3a9a63"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#ffffff"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg></div><small>Mana Orchestrate · 淡底 64 / 32 · 深底 64 / 32</small></div><div class="tl"><div class="r"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#eceefc"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6577f3"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#3096f4"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#43d4cf"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#78b957"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="tile-tint" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#eceefc"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6577f3"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#3096f4"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#43d4cf"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#78b957"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="64"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#6577f3"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="tile-deep" data-size="32"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="11" fill="#6577f3"/><g transform="translate(7.2 7.2) scale(0.7)"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#ffffff"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#ffffff"/></g></svg></div><small>TCRN Design System · 淡底 64 / 32 · 深底 64 / 32</small></div></div></div></div>
<div class="blk"><h6>D · 单色版 <span>只有墨色可用时（打印、水印、禁色场合）；形不变，两色并成一色</span></h6><div class="paper"><div class="mono4"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div></div></div>
<div class="blk"><h6>E · 锁定块与侧栏 <span>TCRN 产品字标 Hanken Grotesk 600，「TCRN」墨色、后缀用各自产品的深色（TMS #2c63c8、Design System #6577f3）；Einzbern 与 Mana Orchestrate 是完整名称，Source Serif 4 墨色加 by TCRN</span></h6><div class="paper"><div class="lock"><div class="lk" role="img" aria-label="TCRN TMS 艺人管理系统"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="44"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg><span class="w" aria-hidden="true"><b class="">TCRN <em style="color:#2c63c8">TMS</em></b><small>艺人管理系统</small></span></div><div class="lk" role="img" aria-label="Einzbern 项目记忆引擎"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="color" data-size="44"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#3b5272"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#3b5272"/></svg><span class="w" aria-hidden="true"><b class="serif">Einzbern</b><small>项目记忆引擎</small><small class="by">by TCRN</small></span></div><div class="lk" role="img" aria-label="Mana Orchestrate 项目记忆助手"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="color" data-size="44"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#9ddc8c" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/></svg><span class="w" aria-hidden="true"><b class="serif">Mana Orchestrate</b><small>项目记忆助手</small><small class="by">by TCRN</small></span></div><div class="lk" role="img" aria-label="TCRN Design System 设计系统"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="44" height="44" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="color" data-size="44"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6577f3"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#3096f4"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#43d4cf"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#78b957"/></svg><span class="w" aria-hidden="true"><b class="">TCRN <em style="color:#6577f3">Design System</em></b><small>设计系统</small></span></div></div><div class="row" style="gap:16px;margin-top:6px"><div class="rail"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="22"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg><span><b class="">TCRN <em style="color:#2c63c8">TMS</em></b><small>艺人管理系统</small></span></div><div class="rail"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="color" data-size="22"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#3b5272"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#3b5272"/></svg><span><b class="serif">Einzbern</b><small>项目记忆引擎</small></span></div><div class="rail"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="color" data-size="22"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#9ddc8c" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/></svg><span><b class="serif">Mana Orchestrate</b><small>项目记忆助手</small></span></div><div class="rail"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="color" data-size="22"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6577f3"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#3096f4"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#43d4cf"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#78b957"/></svg><span><b class="">TCRN <em style="color:#6577f3">Design System</em></b><small>设计系统</small></span></div></div></div></div>
</section><section class="pane gp night" aria-label="夜间">
<svg class="grain" aria-hidden="true"><filter id="lg2-n"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.9" numOctaves="2" stitchTiles="stitch"/><feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0"/></filter><rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#lg2-n)"/></svg>
<span class="ptag">night · 画布 #121210 · 纸 #191916</span>
<div class="blk"><h6>A · 四枚标 <span>实心几何，每枚两种平涂色；48 格，圆角 4；没有描边、渐变、投影</span></h6><div class="hero"><div class="hb"><div class="st"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="200" height="200" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="200"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg></div><h5>TCRN TMS<small>艺人管理系统</small></h5><div class="chips"><span class="chip"><i style="background:#2c63c8"></i>#2c63c8</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#7aa0f5"></i>#7aa0f5</span></div><p>一个艺人双臂高举的剪影：头是一个圆，手臂是一个 V。V 既是 VTuber 的 V，也是谢幕、安可时的姿势；两条手臂一深一浅，像聚光灯打在一侧。</p></div><div class="hb"><div class="st"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="200" height="200" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="color" data-size="200"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="#3b5272"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#8aa6c9"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="#3b5272"/></svg></div><h5>Einzbern<small>项目记忆引擎</small></h5><div class="chips"><span class="chip"><i style="background:#3b5272"></i>#3b5272</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#8aa6c9"></i>#8aa6c9</span></div><p>一只盃接住一点光，盃下是两层基座：圣杯接住的是愿望，引擎接住的是项目的记忆；两层基座是存下来的层（纪要、卡片）。深浅交替，像一枚徽记。</p></div><div class="hb"><div class="st"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="200" height="200" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="color" data-size="200"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="#9ddc8c" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="#3a9a63"/></svg></div><h5>Mana Orchestrate<small>项目记忆助手</small></h5><div class="chips"><span class="chip"><i style="background:#3a9a63"></i>#3a9a63</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#9ddc8c"></i>#9ddc8c</span></div><p>两个结点，一道流：mana 从代理流到引擎，再流回来。结点是深绿，流是亮绿，像一条有生命的带子。</p></div><div class="hb"><div class="st"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="200" height="200" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="color" data-size="200"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="#6577f3"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="#3096f4"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="#43d4cf"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="#78b957"/></svg></div><h5>TCRN Design System<small>设计系统</small></h5><div class="chips"><span class="chip"><i style="background:#6577f3"></i>#6577f3</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#3096f4"></i>#3096f4</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#43d4cf"></i>#43d4cf</span><span class="chip"><i style="background:#78b957"></i>#78b957</span></div><p>一张版面：四块大小不等的面，四种颜色。版面是布局，颜色是调色板，合起来就是设计系统；四种颜色沿用 TCRN 母标的紫蓝、蓝、青、绿。</p></div></div></div>
<div class="blk"><h6>B · 尺寸阶梯 <span>同一个形从 128 到 16，不换切法</span></h6><div class="paper"><div class="ladder"><span></span><span class="hd">128</span><span class="hd">64</span><span class="hd">48</span><span class="hd">32</span><span class="hd">24</span><span class="hd">16</span><b>TCRN TMS</b><span class="c"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="128" height="128" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="128"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg></span><span class="c"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="64"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg></span><span class="c"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48" height="48" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="48"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg></span><span class="c"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="32"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="#7aa0f5" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="#2c63c8"/></svg></span><span class="c"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="color" data-size="24"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="#2c63c8" stroke-width="9" s