<div class="blk"><h6>D · 单色版 <span>只有墨色可用时（打印、水印、禁色场合）；形不变，两色并成一色</span></h6><div class="paper"><div class="mono4"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="tms" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><path d="M11 23L24 39" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M37 23L24 39" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="24" cy="12.5" r="8" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="einzbern" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><circle cx="24" cy="7.5" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M10 14A14 14 0 0 0 38 14Z" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="31" width="18" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="11" y="39" width="26" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="mana" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><path d="M13 13C13 30 35 18 35 35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="13" cy="13" r="7" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="35" cy="35" r="7" fill="currentColor"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" data-logo="ds" data-mode="ink" data-size="56"><rect x="4" y="4" width="17" height="40" rx="4" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="24" y="4" width="20" height="17" rx="4" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="24" y="24" width="9" height="20" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="36" y="24" width="8" height="20" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div></div></div>
